      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# MUSIC VIDEO - ALL IN ONE (LTX 2.5)\n\nThis graph covers planning, cards, and the final video. It pauses twice, then renders video in resumable batches.\n\n### Queue 1 - plan\nLoad your audio file, then queue. Review the timeline, lyrics, references, and prompts at STOP 1. Optional style and subject fields override the song-derived choices.\n\n### Queue 2 - render images\nEnable `approve_timeline` and queue. The run is saved, reference sheets and all cards render, then STOP 2 lets you review the deck.\n\n### Video batches - render and resume\nEnable `approve_cards` and queue. The LTX 2.5 node renders `segments_per_queue` unfinished clips per execution (default 4), saves each clip immediately, and skips completed clips next time. Queue again until all clips are present, or use the remaining Queue batch count shown by the status panel. LTX uses first/last-frame guides and `end_guide_strength`.\n\nThe stitcher may show an incomplete preview after an early batch; `final_music_video.mp4` is complete after every segment exists.\n\nA single **Card + video size** node keeps the cards and video at the same aspect ratio. All outputs stay under one run folder in `output/storyboard_projects/`: `project.json`, `song.wav`, `references/`, `cards/`, `clips/`, `segments/`, and `final_music_video.mp4`."
      ],
      "title": "READ ME - two stops, then video batches",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
